563aba5c547b9919941c6579be341","sessionId":null,"userId":100078,"orgId":3721,"botId":1033,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"你这么一说……好像是。我好像习惯了先看别人脸色。在家里更是，做什么决定都得先想我妈会怎么反应，有时候明明是我自己的事，也弄得跟要经过她批准一样。<第9轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":18,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0052183370707055724,"emotions":[{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":4,"sort":4},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":3,"sort":5},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":3,"sort":6},{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":3,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":3,"sort":9},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":2,"sort":3},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":1,"sort":7},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":0,"sort":2}],"relationId":"6af6b5b9f4429d1fd72fa9c5","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794553273460,"createTime":"2026-11-13 15:01:13","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af6b5b5f4429d1fd72fa9c0","chatId":"f8c563aba5c547b9919941c6579be341","sessionId":null,"userId":100078,"orgId":3721,"botId":1033,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"不会，我一点也没觉得麻烦。你愿意把担心直接问出来，而不是自己憋着猜，这其实是很难得的事。倒是“怕自己麻烦到别人”这个念头，好像跟着你挺久了。你平时是不是也常常先替别人考虑，把自己的需要往后放？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"不会，我一点也没觉得麻烦。你愿意把担心直接问出来，而不是自己憋着猜，这其实是很难得的事。倒是“怕自己麻烦到别人”这个念头，好像跟着你挺久了。你平时是不是也常常先替别人考虑，把自己的需要往后放？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","